OL,3,ATrump ordered to answer questions under
OL,4,Aoath in BBC lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US judge has ordered President Donald
OL,7,FTrump to answer questions under oath in
OL,8,Fhis defamation lawsuit against the BBC
OL,9,Fby 11 December.
OL,11,FTrump is suing the BBC over an episode
OL,12,Fof Panorama that edited together two
OL,13,Fdifferent sections of a speech he gave
OL,14,Fbefore the riot at the US Capitol in
OL,15,F2021.
OL,17,FTrump cancelled a previous deposition -
OL,18,For interview under oath - on 16
OL,19,FOctober, citing "matters of national
OL,20,Fimportance".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
