OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA magnitude seven earthquake has hit a
OL,7,Fmountainous region in Tibet, killing at
OL,8,Fleast 16 people and injuring dozens of
OL,9,Fothers, according to Chinese state
OL,10,Fmedia reports.
OL,12,FThe centre of the quake hit Baqen
OL,13,FCounty in the Nagqu region on Thursday
OL,14,Fnight, Xinhua reported, citing the
OL,15,Flocal emergency management bureau. The
OL,16,Fcounty is 400km north-east of Tibet's
OL,17,Fcapital, Lhasa.
OL,19,FAuthorities have declared an emergency
OL,20,Fand deployed rescue teams to the
OL,21,Faffected area, where 32 others have
OL,22,Falso been injured.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
